&lt;p&gt;As one of our first Customer Operations Associates, you will be a trusted advisor to our customers, helping them succeed with our platform and their experience as a Coast customer is as smooth as possible.&amp;nbsp; You’ll be responsible for understanding customer requirements, implementing and onboarding new customers, conducting product training, driving adoption and retention, and ensuring ongoing satisfaction. You’ll partner closely with our account management, product, and engineering teams on resolving customer questions, managing product requests and issues, and bringing insights into how we can improve our product.&lt;/p&gt;
